{"id":18494485893,"name":"A Silent Town","desc":"Monsters called \"Listeners\" have invaded this town, they are blind creatures that have very big ears. You can not escape this town, all the exits are blocked off. You must survive for as long as you can!\n\n- Search around the map for supplies to survive, buildings you spawn in usually have a lot of them!🧰\n- Find a Hammer to build a base and block out any openings!🔨\n- Survive against the Listeners for as long as you can!🕙\n- Monsters can hear your voice with Voice-Chat!🔊\n- Earn money to upgrade your stats permanently!💸\n\nBecoming a Listener is free in VIP servers.\nBe sure to like and favorite the game if you enjoy!\nYour loadout is NOT meant to save, you lose it when you die or leave.\n\nGame is inspired by \"GEF\", and the movie \"A Quiet Place\"","path":"/game/18494485893-a-silent-town","slug":"18494485893-a-silent-town","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/a7b7b07d4b05de4df5c8363da3cb56dae99668d89831cce20ecd7378381b00e5.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ce56133c0c84063b6a8f6eec7bc71b92/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":16,"visitor":19880707,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-08-22T02:38:45.559Z","creator":{"name":"Khongumu","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"A-Silent-Town-Auto-money-collect-224894","_id":"6a890bb5b74b4a5de6cd7df8","title":"Auto money collect","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c78776","gameId":18494485893,"name":"A Silent Town","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":18494485893},"features":"Auto money set getgenv false to stop","tags":[],"script":"getgenv().AutoMoney = true -- Set to false to stop\n\ntask.spawn(function()\n    local Players = game:GetService(\"Players\")\n    local LocalPlayer = Players.LocalPlayer\n    \n    while getgenv().AutoMoney do\n        local character = LocalPlayer.Character\n        local hrp = character and character:FindFirstChild(\"HumanoidRootPart\")\n        \n        if hrp and workspace:FindFirstChild(\"Map\") then\n            for _, item in ipairs(workspace.Map:GetDescendants()) do\n                if not getgenv().AutoMoney then break end\n                \n                if item.Name == \"Money\" then\n                    -- Teleport to the item\n                    if item:IsA(\"BasePart\") then\n                        hrp.CFrame = item.CFrame\n                    elseif item:IsA(\"Model\") and item.PrimaryPart then\n                        hrp.CFrame = item.PrimaryPart.CFrame\n                    end\n                    \n                    task.wait(0.1)\n                    \n                    -- Trigger ProximityPrompts 3 times\n                    local prompt = item:FindFirstChildOfClass(\"ProximityPrompt\") or item:FindFirstChildWhichIsA(\"ProximityPrompt\", true)\n                    if prompt then\n                        for i = 1, 3 do\n                            if not getgenv().AutoMoney then break end\n                            fireproximityprompt(prompt)\n                            task.wait(0.1)\n                        end\n                    end\n                end\n            end\n        end\n        task.wait(1)\n    end\nend)\n","owner":{"_id":"69106c1c98f91b7881f965e3","username":"Royalthess","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/edbe6241b6fe11fa1d1b94d9e3f0b135d431840ea4092588580c37d85723b4d5.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69106c1c98f91b7881f965e3-1765010515140.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"69106c1c98f91b7881f965e3","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":50},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/edbe6241b6fe11fa1d1b94d9e3f0b135d431840ea4092588580c37d85723b4d5.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69106c1c98f91b7881f965e3-1765010515140.j